---
// AI Agent State Machine, Memory and Sandbox Diagram
---

<figure class="agent-diagram" aria-labelledby="agent-caption">
  <svg
    class="agent-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 960 460"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="agent-title agent-desc"
  >
    <title id="agent-title">AI Agent 狀態機架構、記憶工程與工具執行沙盒</title>
    <desc id="agent-desc">
      展示 ReAct/Plan-Solve 狀態機循環、短期與長期記憶架構，以及
      Firecracker/gVisor 微虛擬機工具隔離沙盒與循環熔斷機制。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="agent-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="agent-diagram__arrow-head"
        ></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Column 1: State Machine Loop -->
    <g class="agent-diagram__card" transform="translate(30, 40)">
      <rect width="270" height="370" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="agent-diagram__badge" x="18" y="26"
        >AGENT COGNITIVE ENGINE</text
      >
      <text class="agent-diagram__title" x="18" y="54">狀態機與決策循環</text>

      <g transform="translate(18, 75)">
        <rect
          width="234"
          height="85"
          rx="6"
          class="agent-diagram__subcard agent-diagram__subcard--green"></rect>
        <text
          class="agent-diagram__header agent-diagram__header--green"
          x="12"
          y="22">ReAct 思考循環</text
        >
        <text class="agent-diagram__desc" x="12" y="44"
          >1. Thought: 狀態評估與策略推導</text
        >
        <text class="agent-diagram__desc" x="12" y="62"
          >2. Action: 選擇工具與生成參數</text
        >
        <text class="agent-diagram__desc" x="12" y="80"
          >3. Observation: 接收執行反饋並修正</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(18, 170)">
        <rect
          width="234"
          height="80"
          rx="6"
          class="agent-diagram__subcard agent-diagram__subcard--blue"></rect>
        <text
          class="agent-diagram__header agent-diagram__header--blue"
          x="12"
          y="22">Plan-and-Solve (DAG)</text
        >
        <text class="agent-diagram__desc" x="12" y="42"
          >• 將複雜任務分解為有向無環圖</text
        >
        <text class="agent-diagram__desc" x="12" y="62"
          >• 動態 Re-planning 應對意外分支</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(18, 260)">
        <rect
          width="234"
          height="85"
          rx="6"
          class="agent-diagram__subcard agent-diagram__subcard--orange"></rect>
        <text
          class="agent-diagram__header agent-diagram__header--orange"
          x="12"
          y="22">死循環熔斷 (Cycle Breaker)</text
        >
        <text class="agent-diagram__desc" x="12" y="42"
          >• 重複工具呼叫哈希檢測 (Duplicate Action)</text
        >
        <text class="agent-diagram__desc" x="12" y="62"
          >• 最大步驟 Step Limit (如 25 步)</text
        >
        <text class="agent-diagram__desc" x="12" y="80"
          >• 觸發人工接管 (Human Intervention)</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Column 2: Memory Engineering -->
    <g class="agent-diagram__card" transform="translate(340, 40)">
      <rect width="280" height="370" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="agent-diagram__badge" x="18" y="26">MEMORY ENGINEERING</text>
      <text class="agent-diagram__title" x="18" y="54"
        >短期工作與長期記憶架構</text
      >

      <g transform="translate(18, 75)">
        <rect
          width="244"
          height="85"
          rx="6"
          class="agent-diagram__subcard agent-diagram__subcard--cyan"></rect>
        <text
          class="agent-diagram__header agent-diagram__header--cyan"
          x="12"
          y="22">短期工作記憶 (Working Context)</text
        >
        <text class="agent-diagram__desc" x="12" y="42"
          >• 當前 Session 滑動視窗 (Sliding Window)</text
        >
        <text class="agent-diagram__desc" x="12" y="62"
          >• 遞迴摘要壓縮 (Recursive Summarization)</text
        >
        <text class="agent-diagram__desc" x="12" y="80"
          >• Scratchpad 暫存演算中間結果</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(18, 170)">
        <rect
          width="244"
          height="85"
          rx="6"
          class="agent-diagram__subcard agent-diagram__subcard--purple"></rect>
        <text
          class="agent-diagram__header agent-diagram__header--purple"
          x="12"
          y="22">情境長期記憶 (Episodic Memory)</text
        >
        <text class="agent-diagram__desc" x="12" y="42"
          >• 向量資料庫語義檢索 (Vector RAG)</text
        >
        <text class="agent-diagram__desc" x="12" y="62"
          >• 時間衰減重要性加權 (Recency * Importance)</text
        >
        <text class="agent-diagram__desc" x="12" y="80"
          >• 歷史任務復盤與經驗提取 (Reflection)</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(18, 265)">
        <rect width="244" height="80" rx="6" class="agent-diagram__subcard"
        ></rect>
        <text class="agent-diagram__header" x="12" y="22"
          >語義知識圖譜 (Semantic Memory)</text
        >
        <text class="agent-diagram__desc" x="12" y="42"
          >• 實體關係網路 (Entity-Graph)</text
        >
        <text class="agent-diagram__desc" x="12" y="62"
          >• 精確知識關聯與跨會話偏好沉澱</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Column 3: Tool Execution Sandbox -->
    <g class="agent-diagram__card" transform="translate(660, 40)">
      <rect width="270" height="370" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="agent-diagram__badge" x="18" y="26"
        >SECURE EXECUTION ENVIRONMENT</text
      >
      <text class="agent-diagram__title" x="18" y="54">微虛擬機隔離沙盒</text>

      <g transform="translate(18, 75)">
        <rect
          width="234"
          height="95"
          rx="6"
          class="agent-diagram__subcard agent-diagram__subcard--green"></rect>
        <text
          class="agent-diagram__header agent-diagram__header--green"
          x="12"
          y="22">Firecracker / gVisor 沙盒</text
        >
        <text class="agent-diagram__desc" x="12" y="44"
          >• 毫秒級冷啟動 MicroVM</text
        >
        <text class="agent-diagram__desc" x="12" y="64"
          >• 核心系統調用 (Syscall) 攔截過濾</text
        >
        <text class="agent-diagram__desc" x="12" y="84"
          >• 唯讀 RootFS + 拋棄式臨時目錄</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(18, 180)">
        <rect
          width="234"
          height="85"
          rx="6"
          class="agent-diagram__subcard agent-diagram__subcard--orange"></rect>
        <text
          class="agent-diagram__header agent-diagram__header--orange"
          x="12"
          y="22">雙向授權邊界 (HITL Approval)</text
        >
        <text class="agent-diagram__desc" x="12" y="44"
          >• 高危指令 (寫檔/刪庫/付款) 暫停阻斷</text
        >
        <text class="agent-diagram__desc" x="12" y="64"
          >• 彈出 Human-in-the-loop 審批確認</text
        >
        <text class="agent-diagram__desc" x="12" y="84"
          >• 審批後繼續恢復狀態機 (Resume)</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(18, 275)">
        <rect width="234" height="70" rx="6" class="agent-diagram__subcard"
        ></rect>
        <text class="agent-diagram__header" x="12" y="20">網路與資源限制</text>
        <text class="agent-diagram__desc" x="12" y="40"
          >• 網域白名單 (Egress Whitelist)</text
        >
        <text class="agent-diagram__desc" x="12" y="58"
          >• CPU / 記憶體 / 硬碟 配額硬性隔離</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Connecting Arrows -->
    <path
      d="M 300 220 L 330 220"
      class="agent-diagram__flow-line"
      marker-end="url(#agent-arrow)"></path>
    <path
      d="M 620 220 L 650 220"
      class="agent-diagram__flow-line"
      marker-end="url(#agent-arrow)"></path>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile View -->
  <div class="agent-diagram__mobile">
    <div class="agent-mobile-card agent-mobile-card--green">
      <span class="agent-mobile-badge agent-mobile-badge--green"
        >STEP 1: COGNITIVE FSM</span
      >
      <h4>ReAct 狀態機與循環熔斷</h4>
      <p>
        Thought ➔ Action ➔ Observation
        遞迴演化；透過動作雜湊比對與最大步數限制，徹底防範 LLM 死循環。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="agent-mobile-arrow">↓ 記憶檢索與上下文注入</div>

    <div class="agent-mobile-card agent-mobile-card--purple">
      <span class="agent-mobile-badge agent-mobile-badge--purple"
        >STEP 2: MEMORY ENGINE</span
      >
      <h4>短期工作與長期情境記憶</h4>
      <p>
        結合 Session 滑動視窗摘要、向量資料庫（Vector
        RAG）與知識圖譜，實現精確經驗召回。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="agent-mobile-arrow">↓ 安全邊界調用</div>

    <div class="agent-mobile-card agent-mobile-card--orange">
      <span class="agent-mobile-badge agent-mobile-badge--orange"
        >STEP 3: SANDBOX &amp; HITL</span
      >
      <h4>Firecracker 沙盒與人工審批</h4>
      <p>
        使用 MicroVM 隔離惡意程式碼執行，高危操作觸發 Human-in-the-loop
        人工審批確認。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="agent-caption" class="agent-diagram__caption">
    圖 2：AI Agent 狀態機架構、記憶工程與工具執行安全沙盒
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .agent-diagram {
    margin: 2rem 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .agent-diagram__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .agent-diagram__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  .agent-diagram__caption {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--dg-muted);
  }

  .agent-diagram__card rect {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .agent-diagram__card rect {
    fill: #0f172a;
    stroke: #1e293b;
  }

  .agent-diagram__badge {
    font-family:
      ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--dg-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .agent-diagram__badge {
    fill: #94a3b8;
  }

  .agent-diagram__title {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .agent-diagram__title {
    fill: #f8fafc;
  }

  .agent-diagram__subcard {
    fill: #ffffff;
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .agent-diagram__subcard {
    fill: #1e293b;
    stroke: #334155;
  }

  .agent-diagram__subcard--green {
    stroke: #10b981;
    fill: #f0fdf4;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .agent-diagram__subcard--green {
    stroke: #059669;
    fill: #064e3b;
  }

  .agent-diagram__subcard--blue {
    stroke: #38bdf8;
    fill: #f0f9ff;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .agent-diagram__subcard--blue {
    stroke: #0284c7;
    fill: #0c4a6e;
  }

  .agent-diagram__subcard--orange {
    stroke: #f97316;
    fill: #fff7ed;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .agent-diagram__subcard--orange {
    stroke: #ea580c;
    fill: #431407;
  }

  .agent-diagram__subcard--cyan {
    stroke: #22d3ee;
    fill: #ecfeff;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .agent-diagram__subcard--cyan {
    stroke: #0891b2;
    fill: #083344;
  }

  .agent-diagram__subcard--purple {
    stroke: #c084fc;
    fill: #faf5ff;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .agent-diagram__subcard--purple {
    stroke: #9333ea;
    fill: #3b0764;
  }

  .agent-diagram__header {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: #0f172a;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .agent-diagram__header {
    fill: #f8fafc;
  }

  .agent-diagram__header--green {
    fill: #047857;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .agent-diagram__header--green {
    fill: #34d399;
  }

  .agent-diagram__header--blue {
    fill: #0284c7;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .agent-diagram__header--blue {
    fill: #38bdf8;
  }

  .agent-diagram__header--orange {
    fill: #c2410c;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .agent-diagram__header--orange {
    fill: #fb923c;
  }

  .agent-diagram__header--cyan {
    fill: #0e7490;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .agent-diagram__header--cyan {
    fill: #22d3ee;
  }

  .agent-diagram__header--purple {
    fill: #7e22ce;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .agent-diagram__header--purple {
    fill: #c084fc;
  }

  .agent-diagram__desc {
    font-size: 11px;
    fill: var(--dg-muted);
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .agent-diagram__desc {
    fill: #94a3b8;
  }

  .agent-diagram__flow-line {
    stroke: #10b981;
    stroke-width: 2;
    fill: none;
    stroke-dasharray: 4, 4;
  }

  .agent-diagram__arrow-head {
    fill: #10b981;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .agent-diagram__desktop {
      display: none;
    }

    .agent-diagram__mobile {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .agent-mobile-card {
      padding: 1rem;
      background: var(--dg-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule);
      border-radius: 10px;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .agent-mobile-card {
      background: #0f172a;
      border-color: #1e293b;
    }

    .agent-mobile-card--green {
      border-left: 4px solid #10b981;
      background: #f0fdf4;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .agent-mobile-card--green {
      background: #064e3b;
      border-color: #34d399;
    }

    .agent-mobile-card--purple {
      border-left: 4px solid #7e22ce;
      background: #faf5ff;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .agent-mobile-card--purple {
      background: #3b0764;
      border-color: #a855f7;
    }

    .agent-mobile-card--orange {
      border-left: 4px solid #f97316;
      background: #fff7ed;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .agent-mobile-card--orange {
      background: #431407;
      border-color: #fb923c;
    }

    .agent-mobile-badge {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    .agent-mobile-badge--green {
      color: #047857;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .agent-mobile-badge--green {
      color: #34d399;
    }

    .agent-mobile-badge--purple {
      color: #7e22ce;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .agent-mobile-badge--purple {
      color: #c084fc;
    }

    .agent-mobile-badge--orange {
      color: #ea580c;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .agent-mobile-badge--orange {
      color: #fb923c;
    }

    .agent-mobile-card h4 {
      margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-ink);
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .agent-mobile-card h4 {
      color: #f8fafc;
    }

    .agent-mobile-card p {
      margin: 0.25rem 0;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      color: var(--dg-ink-2);
      line-height: 1.4;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .agent-mobile-card p {
      color: #cbd5e1;
    }

    .agent-mobile-arrow {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--dg-muted);
      padding: 0.125rem 0;
    }
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .agent-diagram__flow-line {
    stroke: #3ddc9a;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .agent-diagram__arrow-head {
    fill: #3ddc9a;
  }
</style>
